There was one time when I was punished (with heavy iron ball).  I was then
trapped in a bear trap, and I decided to throw the iron ball, which pulls you
out of the pit if you are in one, since I never tried it with a bear trap,
and it said:

The heavy iron ball pulls you out of the bear trap. -more-
Your left leg suffers serious damage.

And it made it impossible for me to kick for a *long* time.

As for the second message, unfortunately, it killed me.  It has a bit of
spoiler in it...

I didn't realize that I was playing in the midnight hour (forgot to look at
the clock).  So, when I came upon a graveyard, instead of the standard:

You have an uncanny feeling...

It had:

Run away!  Run away!

I didn't know what it meant right away, but I understood it soon.  :-(

(For those of you who didn't know, undead do double damage from 12 to 1.)

The Rabbit of Seville hits! -more-
You feel perplexed. -more-
You feel vexed. -more-
You feel next. -more-
The Rabbit cuts your mop. -more-
The Rabbit shaves your crop. -more-


